an></h5><h5 class=\"media-heading\"><span class=\"text-black\">Shandong University</span></h5></div></div></a></div><div class=\"col-sm-6\"><a href=\"https://conf.researchr.org/profile/issta-2025/jackykeung\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"navigate\"><div class=\"media\"><span class=\"pull-left\"><img alt=\"Jacky Keung\" src=\"https://conf.researchr.org/getProfileImage/jackykeung/a2e30b3e-0bf3-4589-ad49-85fb1e94319d/micro-avatar?1793464011000\" class=\"outputimage media-object thumbnail no-bottom-margin\"/></span><div class=\"media-body\"><h5 class=\"media-heading\">Jacky Keung<span class=\"pull-right\"><small></small></span></h5><h5 class=\"media-heading\"><span class=\"text-black\">City University of Hong Kong</span></h5><h5 class=\"media-heading\"><small>Hong Kong SAR China</small></h5></div></div></a></div></div></div><br><br><div class=\"panel panel-default\"><div class=\"panel-heading clearfix\"><div class=\"panel-title\"><strong><span class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-log-in\"></span> Information for Participants</strong></div></div><div class=\"panel-body\"><div class=\"well well-sm\"><strong>Wed 25 Jun 2025 11:00 - 12:15 at <a href=\"https://conf.researchr.org/room/issta-2025/issta-2025-venue-cosmos-3a\" class=\"room-link navigate\">Cosmos 3A</a></strong> - <a href=\"https://conf.researchr.org/track/issta-2025/issta-2025-papers#program\" class=\"navigate\">Fairness and LLM Testing</a> <small>Chair(s): <a href=\"https://conf.researchr.org/profile/issta-2025/andreasmetzger\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"navigate\">Andreas Metzger</a></small><div class=\"text-muted\">Info for room <strong>Cosmos 3A</strong>: </div><blockquote class=\"info-participants\"><p>Cosmos 3A is the first room in the Cosmos 3 wing.</p>\n<p>When facing the main Cosmos Hall, access to the Cosmos 3 wing is on the left, close to the stairs. The area is accessed through a large door with the number \u201C3\u201D, which will stay open during the event.</p>\n</blockquote></div></div></div></div><div class=\